# Optional: override API origin for `vite build` / `vite preview` (production mode).
# Leave unset for relative `/api` (same host as the UI, e.g. Express serving `web/dist`).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
#
# `vite dev` always uses relative `/api` (Vite proxy) — this variable is ignored in development.
